  "semantic_rules": [
    "mailbox identifier binds the exact canonical read and write public capability keys",
    "HPKE info is domain separated and AAD is the exact canonical envelope context",
    "write authorization binds mailbox item TTL envelope length and domain-separated envelope digest",
    "list and delete are closed read-operation variants signed by the matching read capability",
    "storage offer binds endpoint policy capacity lifetime nonce and bounded admission work",
    "stored receipt binds the exact envelope and delete receipt binds the exact stored-receipt identifier",
    "all signed objects reject invalid keys signatures versions variants lengths TTLs and substitutions"
